{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01267","headline":"相和歌辞 胡无人行 · 徐彦伯","name":"相和歌辞 胡无人行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十月繁霜下，征人远凿空。\n云摇锦更节，海照角端弓。\n暗碛埋砂树，冲飙卷塞蓬。\n方随膜拜入，歌舞玉门中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}